Alphabet
    %{A%}:а %{A%}:о
    %{M%}:0
    >:>
    а:а о:о
    I:I I:Ӏ I:ӏ I:1 ;

Rules

"A is o before the masculine marker (-лъов, -лъо)"
%{A%}:о <=> _ >:> %{M%}:0 ;

"Remove the masculine archiphoneme"
%{M%}:0 <=> _ ;

"Palochka: the lexicon writes it as Latin I; on the surface it may be I, Ӏ (U+04C0), ӏ (U+04CF) or 1"
I:Ӏ => _ ;
